        "richtext_D6qTmN": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>“Chemistry Lessons”</strong> is a series of entertaining and educational videos from Re[Sens], the first Ukrainian high-biotech sustainable professional skincare brand. This project was created to explain the complex in simple terms — and to make the world of cosmetics more accessible, honest, and conscious.</p>",
